397 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 298 0 R
/T (       The darkness all around me continues to become more and more complete, a curtain drawing to a close between me and the rest of the world. Then, I suddenly hear a single note cut through the noise, and out of the darkness I witness a brilliant light, a calming force emerging from the obscurity. It continues to grow, casting away the remnants of the shadow. As the whispers die away, I find my mind startlingly clear and empty of thought altogether. Until, in the presence of this light, I feel an impression upon my mind, not words, but deeply understood. It soon departs from my mind, leaving behind not an absence, but a feeling of peace throughout my body and soul. The baton descends.)
/E (       The darkness all around me continues to become more and more complete, a curtain drawing to a close between me and the rest of the world. Then, I suddenly hear a single note cut through the noise, and out of the darkness I witness a brilliant light, a calming force emerging from the obscurity. It continues to grow, casting away the remnants of the shadow. As the whispers die away, I find my mind startlingly clear and empty of thought altogether. Until, in the presence of this light, I feel an impression upon my mind, not words, but deeply understood. It soon departs from my mind, leaving behind not an absence, but a feeling of peace throughout my body and soul. The baton descends.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
