497 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 332 0 R
/E (        As I reached an area with cell reception, my phone had a seizure, with an unknown number texting "DO NOT GO INTO THE BUNKER. WHAT WAS SEALED INSIDE WAS NEVER MEANT TO BE RELEASED," over and over again. I am sending this to the web. Because I NEED someone to believe me, believe what I saw. And the world needs to know this: Chornobyl was not just a power plant, and the disaster was not an accident. It was a laboratory, and the disaster was a cover-up from what actually happened on April 26, 1986, meant to keep us from finding out what really lurks in the shadows of that city.)
/Pg 55 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
